        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Arabella Chapman\n- Organizations: Albany School for Educating People of Color, Albany High School, Albany Free Academy\n- Places: upstate New York\n\nFacts:\n- Albany Free Academy opened on September 7, 1868.\n- Albany School for Educating People of Color was later known as Albany High School.\n- Arabella Chapman was an African-American woman who lived from 1859 to 1927.\n- Arabella Chapman is best remembered as the first student to graduate from upstate New York's Albany School for Educating People of Color.",
